  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-05-02",
   "text": "Ending Forced Arbitration of Race Discrimination Act of 2023 \n This bill prohibits a predispute arbitration agreement from being valid or enforceable with respect to a case relating to a race discrimination dispute at the election of the person alleging the discrimination."
  }
